OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Predatory' doctor should have
OL,4,Abeen barred, High Court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "predatory" doctor should have been
OL,7,Fstruck off for carrying out "sexually
OL,8,Fmotivated examinations" of junior
OL,9,Fcolleagues, a High Court judge has
OL,10,Fruled.
OL,12,FDr Khush Bakhat Muhammad Zeeshan was
OL,13,Fsuspended for 12 months by the Medical
OL,14,FPractitioners Tribunal Service over
OL,15,Fincidents at the Royal Albert
OL,16,FInfirmary.
OL,18,FIt took into account that he had not
OL,19,Fcommitted the misconduct again, and
OL,20,Fthat some colleagues spoke in his
OL,21,Ffavour.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
