OL,3,GNEWSA'Predatory' doctor should have
OL,4,Abeen barred, High Court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in overturning the tribunal's
OL,7,Fdecision, Mr Justice Squires said the
OL,8,Ffact that Zeeshan "had not repeated the
OL,9,Fmisconduct while under active
OL,10,Finvestigation cold not be sufficient"
OL,11,Fto avoid being barred from the
OL,12,Fprofession.
